appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Interrupting Politely and Dealing with Interruptions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " In English, sometimes we need to interrupt people. This can be because we need to say something, express our opinion, or make a suggestion. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " Interruptions are acceptable in conversations, but too many interruptions can seem rude. Here are some common ways we can interrupt someone: ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Interrupting Politely</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Getting Back to the Subject</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Sorry for interrupting, but ...</li> <li>Excuse me for butting in, but ... </li> <li>Can I stop you there for a second? </li> <li>Can I just say something here?</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Well/Anyway, as I was saying ... </li> <li>Going back to what I was saying ... </li> <li>Where was I?</li> <li>Now, what was I saying? </li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Sorry, for interrupting, but</span> what kind of information did you get? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Now, what was I saying?</span> Oh right, they need help with their brand. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Dealing with Communication Breakdowns", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " Sometimes you don't understand what was said or something was not clear to you. It is, therefore, important to express your lack of understanding and seek clarification from the person you are talking to.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Expressing lack of understanding</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Asking for clarification</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Sorry, I am not sure I am following you. </li> <li>I beg your pardon, but I don't quite understand. </li> <li>I'm not sure I know what you mean.</li> <li>I'm not sure I follow you. </li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Could you elaborate on that? </li> <li>Could you be more specific?</li> <li>Could you repeat that, please? </li> <li>Could you clarify that, please?</li> <li>Do you mean ... ? </li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": " <span class=\"strong\">Sorry, I am not sure I am following you. Could you be more specific?</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": " <span class=\"strong\">I beg your pardon, but I don't quite understand. You mean</span> the new fashion line?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "insight ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a clear understanding of something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I had a chance to get a better insight into their company.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use in a business meeting. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": 