eed help with their image and a new clothing line to substitute for the last one.", "id": 2, "time": "22250", "image": "engenn6le04ob07re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: OK. So what can we do to make things easier for them? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: We need to formalize an offer with a plan for their image management, media and publicity for their new clothing line. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I'm not sure I know what you mean. Could you clarify that, please? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Well, I'm thinking of creating a Business Link page and pitching it to Farmani.", "id": 3, "time": "47000", "image": "engenn6le04ob07re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le04ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le04ob07re2img07.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}